  Subtitle: Swarm command - the machine intelligence
  Briefing: 'This is the end of the line: the Omega Core, the intelligence behind
    the invasion.

    The fortress throws everything at you before the core wakes.
    It will transform as it takes damage. Finish it.'
  Objectives: '- Storm the fortress

    - Destroy the Destroyer Mk.II

    - Destroy
    the Omega Core'
